<section class="gg-ad-landing">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-ad-hero">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower</span>
      <h1>Grow goals that actually stick.</h1>
      <p>
        Most productivity apps give you another checklist. Goal Grower turns your goals into
        a living garden. Every goal becomes a plant. Every completed habit helps it grow.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Join Beta Testing</a>
        <a href="/pages/about" class="gg-btn-soft">Learn More</a>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-trust-line">
        <span>✓ Early access</span>
        <span>✓ Shape future features</span>
        <span>✓ No spam</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-awareness-grid">
      <div class="gg-awareness-card">
        <span>🌱</span>
        <h2>Visual progress</h2>
        <p>See your effort grow instead of watching another streak number.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-awareness-card">
        <span>💧</span>
        <h2>Build consistency</h2>
        <p>Small actions repeated daily become meaningful results.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-awareness-card">
        <span>🤝</span>
        <h2>Grow together</h2>
        <p>Invite friends into shared gardens and stay accountable together.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-ad-section">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Why Goal Grower?</span>
      <h2>Progress should feel rewarding.</h2>
      <p>
        Instead of feeling guilty for what you have not done, Goal Grower helps you focus
        on what you are growing.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn">Join the Beta</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

